   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've escalated both orders to a human specialist and noted them on your account:\n\n- **#6503 (Taqueria Luz)**, reference **ESC-700**: you never saw the 7:00 PM notification and were waiting from 6:30.\n- **#6504 (Burger Barn)**, reference **ESC-701**: the order was an hour late, but the 7-day window closed before you got in touch.\n\nI included the full details from today, so you won't have to explain it all again. A specialist will contact you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide, but they'll review both orders.\n\nHere's everything from today:\n- **$30 account credit** for late orders #6501 ($25) and #6502 ($5), ready to use on your next order\n- **$9.00 refund** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing summer rolls, arriving in 3\u20135 business days\n- **Escalations ESC-700 and ESC-701** for #6503 and #6504\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
